{"2292010": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Earl vs. the Mutants", "steam_appid": 2292010, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [2976550], "detailed_description": "<h1>OFFICIAL DISCORD SERVER</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292010/extras/163049b388940a705f89a4b395b2f9a7.poster.avif?t=1723820989\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292010/extras/163049b388940a705f89a4b395b2f9a7.webm?t=1723820989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292010/extras/163049b388940a705f89a4b395b2f9a7.mp4?t=1723820989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Ever wondered what happens when the best pest control expert meets a nuclear apocalypse? Meet Earl, the sole employee of Edna’s Pest Control, and the winner of 37 consecutive Employee of the Month awards. When mutants overrun the world, only Earl and his boss Edna have the guts and the wheels to save humanity!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >-- Why You'll Love Earl vs. the Mutants --</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Be Earl:</strong> Step into the shoes of Earl, the underdog hero who uses his pest control skills to destroy the mutants<br></li><li><strong>Crazy Combos:</strong> Combine vehicle-mounted weapons, attack drones, and wild powerups to create unstoppable builds<br></li><li><strong>Fast and Furious:</strong> Quick runs averaging 5-10 minutes keep the action intense and engaging<br></li><li><strong>Smash and Crash:</strong> Drive headfirst into mutant swarms and enjoy the carnage<br></li><li><strong>Steam Deck Ready:</strong> Optimized for seamless play on Steam Deck!</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >-- Earl's World --</h2>Navigate through 3D terrain, use elevation to your adv